  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 703.01 Further Investigation and Public Hearing.\n\n(a) If the department finds a serious and adverse effect under Env-Wr 702.02(c) and (d), the department shall conduct a further investigation.\n\n(b) If the department determines that a public hearing to receive information would be helpful to its further investigation, the department shall schedule and conduct the public hearing in accordance with Env-C 200 relative to non-adjudicative procedures.\n\nSource. #4278, eff 6-30-87; ss by #5662, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED: 7-1-99\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05 (formerly Env-Wr 401.03); ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
